OL,3,GNEWSA'Don't take away our children's
OL,4,ASEND rights'
OL,5,
OL,6,FParents say they are concerned changes
OL,7,Fto special educational needs and
OL,8,Fdisabilities (SEND) support will give
OL,9,Fthem less power.
OL,11,FDee McMahon, a mum of three SEND
OL,12,Fchildren from Hove and co-leader of
OL,13,FSouthern SEND Families support group,
OL,14,Fsaid families still needed "enforcement
OL,15,Fwhen the system gets it wrong".
OL,17,FThe government is writing off SEND
OL,18,Fdebt, including more than #200m from
OL,19,FSussex councils, in exchange for more
OL,20,Finclusion in mainstream schools and
OL,21,Flimiting legally-binding support plans
OL,22,Fto those with the most complex needs.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,330,320,200,140,0,100
